<section class="studio-story section-shell"><span class="eyebrow">01 / Where we’re coming from</span><div><h2>From the red dirt road<br>to the <span class="serif-word">red carpet.</span></h2><p>Stolen Tribe is an independent TV and film content studio based in Jersey City, New Jersey. Our mission is to amplify the voices of the Black diaspora through storytelling across film, television, digital media and publishing.</p><p>Our roots reach across African, Brazilian, American, Caribbean, LatinX and European experiences. We bring those histories into conversation, creating space for stories that feel specific, authentic and connected to something bigger.</p><p>We’re growing a tribe of storytellers, production minds and creative collaborators. Different backgrounds. A shared belief in what a story can do.</p></div></section>
<section class="studio-values section-shell"><div class="section-topline"><span class="eyebrow">02 / Our compass</span><span class="eyebrow">How we see the world</span></div><div class="values-grid"><article><span class="eyebrow">01</span><h3>Culture is<br>the starting point.</h3><p>Specificity gives a story its soul. We start with lived experience, rich heritage and voices with something to say.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">02</span><h3>Curiosity<br>opens the frame.</h3><p>We make room for different perspectives, unexpected formats and ideas that deserve to be explored.</p></article><article><span class="eyebrow">03</span><h3>It takes<br>a tribe.</h3><p>Stories are made together. We’re building a community around the belief that a shared vision can travel further.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="people-placeholder section-shell"><span class="eyebrow">03 / The faces behind the stories</span><h2>THE TRIBE IS<br><span class="serif-word">coming into focus.</span></h2><p>There’s a place here for the people behind the work.<br>Team portraits, introductions and creative collaborators will follow.</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ '/contact/' | asset }}">Want to be part of the story? {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></section>
